#: class-simple-review.php:14
msgid "Hi there! Stoked to see you're using Simple Custom Post Order for a few days now - hope you like it! And if you do, please consider rating it. It would mean the world to us.  Keep on rocking!"
msgstr "Ei! Encantats de veure que ja fa uns dies que esteu utilitzant Simple Custom Post Order. Esperem que us agradi! I, si és així, si us plau, dediqueu uns minuts a valorar-lo. Ens ajudaria moltíssim. Gràcies!"

